classDiagram
    class ReapTarget {
        lexicalPath 词法路径·验 symlink 用
        canonicalPath 规范路径·匹配用
        expectedParentDir 期望父目录
        repoSlugPrefix 目录名前缀
        rootProof live-dir 或 gone
    }
    class CwdRow {
        pid 进程号
        rawCwd 原始输出·只审计
        logicalCwd 逻辑路径·唯一匹配依据
        deletedMarker Linux 删除标记
    }
    class ReapSummary {
        matched 命中数
        reaped 确认清掉的
        survivors 幸存者·如实报
        verified 终验通过?
        identityMismatchSkipped 身份不符跳过数
        scanError 信号前失败·零信号
        verifyError 信号后不确定·停止升级
        refusedReason 守卫拒绝·零信号
    }
    class WorktreeManager {
        removeUnlocked() 改名删除路径
        removeCleanWorktreeByPath() git worktree remove
        removeWorktreeForce() 强制删除
        removeIfExists() 开工前清残留
        pruneOrphans() +收敛清扫
    }
    class reapWorktreeProcesses {
        六步算法·全依赖可注入
    }
    WorktreeManager --> reapWorktreeProcesses : 删除前调用
    reapWorktreeProcesses --> ReapTarget : 输入·manager 派生
    reapWorktreeProcesses --> CwdRow : 共享 cwd 解析
    reapWorktreeProcesses --> ReapSummary : 输出·进审计账
